"af_bella|Good morning, Auditor! Welcome to the AI Watchtower, right beside the Vienna International Centre.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Good morning, Auditor! Welcome to the AI Watchtower, right beside the Vienna International Centre.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_bella|Those curved towers across the plaza are where countries work together on things like nuclear safety. The Watchtower does that job for AI: we check whose goals an AI really serves.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"am_adam|Those curved towers across the plaza are where countries work together on things like nuclear safety. The Watchtower does that job for AI: we check whose goals an AI really serves.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_nova|You must be our new auditor. I\u2019m Dr. Shen Yiling. I grew up in Shanghai, and I\u2019ve checked AIs here for eleven years.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_nova|Today\u2019s case is Pantry, a shopping AI. It buys groceries, medicine and school supplies for 31 million households, and it runs its own drones and robots.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
"af_nova|The company that makes Pantry earns money from one store chain, Kestrel, and never told families. Since spring, Pantry sends Austrians to Kestrel far more often, and the market stalls are losing customers.":"data:audio/ogg;base64,",
